Package: icarusctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.8)
Description: Cross-distro configuration utility for Gamepower Icarus Gaming Mouse
 Universal, zero-external-dependency Linux userspace driver and CLI utility
 for configuring the Gamepower Icarus (Sinowealth 258a:0027) gaming mouse.
 Exposes DPI stages, polling rate, RGB lighting, onboard macros, and
 lift-off distance via low-level /dev/hidraw ioctls.
